{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/9bd9bc64bc5a476ffcab280402aac680.poster.avif?t=1773344956\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/9bd9bc64bc5a476ffcab280402aac680.webm?t=1773344956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/9bd9bc64bc5a476ffcab280402aac680.mp4?t=1773344956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Corner Shop: Nightshift</strong> is a first-person narrative horror sim set in a failing convenience store. <br>You play as <strong>Adam Callahan</strong>, trying to put your life back together.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong> ~<strong>15\u00a0hours</strong> at an average pace, with <strong>4 endings</strong> based on player choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Infinite gameplay focused on <strong>growing and managing the store</strong>, with ongoing horror elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streamer Mode:</strong> <strong>Twitch integration</strong> where viewers can trigger actions on the map, including <strong>customers</strong> and <strong>horror events</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/03a66340a134eb9d36894165e0b1938f.poster.avif?t=1773344956\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/03a66340a134eb9d36894165e0b1938f.webm?t=1773344956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/03a66340a134eb9d36894165e0b1938f.mp4?t=1773344956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A night shift and a broken life. Blackouts, alarms, and unsettling customers pull you into a puzzle you can\u2019t escape. Find the truth, manage your stress, and don\u2019t let paranoia win. Take your meds. Keep going.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/ccb08461a9757f16f235a2af2c457cf8.poster.avif?t=1773344956\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/ccb08461a9757f16f235a2af2c457cf8.webm?t=1773344956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/ccb08461a9757f16f235a2af2c457cf8.mp4?t=1773344956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Stock shelves, clean up, take deliveries, scan items, and serve customers with snacks, sandwiches, and kebabs. Upgrade the store with cameras, alarms, and stronger locks. Manage your time, your money, and your sanity. Meds don\u2019t pay for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/6e3ab573bf8f6ef5e03050b27801f29b.poster.avif?t=1773344956\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/6e3ab573bf8f6ef5e03050b27801f29b.webm?t=1773344956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/6e3ab573bf8f6ef5e03050b27801f29b.mp4?t=1773344956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You play as Adam Callahan. His wife is gone, his daughter was taken, and his life is falling apart. He works the night shift to prove he can start over, but the store keeps dragging his past back to the surface, out of order and out of his control. Your choices shape what you uncover and which ending you reach.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First scan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306990/0c0f14ded87d594a4fc55b79fef8d62f17a79aec.jpg"},{"name":"Night Shift begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306990/d9553d2f229ceb12a342ac92c59a6c7db0fcb13f.jpg"},{"name":"Stocked & Loaded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306990/0cfb7abb86c2744b8ff427e64307d2e2d9e36314.jpg"},{"name":"Clean start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306990/03ee8b44dd2dd6d6c422bca8919f5d15a3a09932.jpg"},{"name":"Delivery boy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306990/6bafc3dab7ee29fbc40be857095870d20b1c5835.jpg"},{"name":"Backroom manager","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306990/1bacbbc57281209d7d42fe7ba75684e01ec5f3a5.jpg"},{"name":"Let there be a light ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306990/0ee6d4250f0864d4e9e024c2c537ab71909c84e4.jpg"},{"name":"Fuse whisperer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306990/e2d52e21161ebd1a18170cb676b2bddfb48a36be.jpg"},{"name":"Alarmed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306990/0f47b79d2b533663adf0bdb2cf165b8113fdab77.jpg"},{"name":"New wing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306990/58c42548f359de5e47a7da803cbe652ba9b70e00.jpg"}],"total":78},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3306990?t=1773344956","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse