, take deliveries, scan items, and serve customers with snacks, sandwiches, and kebabs. Upgrade the store with cameras, alarms, and stronger locks. Manage your time, your money, and your sanity. Meds don\u2019t pay for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/6e3ab573bf8f6ef5e03050b27801f29b.poster.avif?t=1773344956\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/6e3ab573bf8f6ef5e03050b27801f29b.webm?t=1773344956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/6e3ab573bf8f6ef5e03050b27801f29b.mp4?t=1773344956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You play as Adam Callahan. His wife is gone, his daughter was taken, and his life is falling apart. He works the night shift to prove he can start over, but the store keeps dragging his past back to the surface, out of order and out of his control. Your choices shape what you uncover and which ending you reach.</p>","developers":["Live Motion Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/d9606f6c3de3208e16e1b16ad8c2650d25edebd3/header.jpg?t=1773344956","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3306990/979498601/eaaa6ebe58984f7f50361a64aa9e9a5b4c811642/1772788036/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772792226","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3306990/979498601/eaaa6ebe58984f7f50361a64aa9e9a5b4c811642/1772788036/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772792226","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstati